```python
def episode_latency(arm, models):
    lat = sum(models[arm.models[s % len(arm.models)]].latency_s for s in range(arm.samples)) if arm.kind in (...) else models[arm.models[0]].latency_s*arm.samples
    if arm.coordinator: lat += arm.coordinator_latency_s
    return lat
```
